---
Make BPM/Swing/Volume sliders interactive in toolbar.

Currently these display values but cannot be dragged to change them.
Implement click-drag interaction for BPM, swing, and master volume controls.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] BPM slider: click-drag changes BPM in real time
- [ ] Swing slider: click-drag changes swing amount
- [ ] Volume slider: click-drag changes master volume
- [ ] Values clamped to valid ranges (BPM 20-300, Swing 0-100%, Vol 0-100%)
- [ ] Value displays update during drag
- [ ] Changes take effect immediately in audio engine

## Test Plan
- [ ] Drag each slider, verify value changes and audio responds
- [ ] Drag to extremes, verify clamping
- [ ] Visual: slider position matches displayed value
